# Insert Picture: the dialog starts in the last folder, and a file that is not a picture says so on the status line.
@copy pic.bmp
@file "NOTE.TXT" "not a picture"
cmd Picture
expect file Picture folder="" name=""
choose "C:\\PICS\\NOTE.TXT"
expect notice "Quill cannot use that picture." Status
dump
cmd Picture
expect file Picture folder="C:\\PICS\\"
choose "PIC.BMP"
dump
